"doses_a, doses_b (1D arrays), viability_matrix (2D). Output: ZIP delta "
"synergy score."
msgstr ""

#: 7ebe55a3f76a48599d6a93ed466edd7e of
#: tooluniverse.drug_synergy_tool.DrugSynergyTool._fit_hill_for_loewe:1
msgid ""
"Fit a Hill/sigmoid model: f(d) = Emax * d^m / (Dm^m + d^m) Returns (Dm, "
"m, Emax) or None if fitting fails. Dm = dose producing half-maximal "
"effect (IC50/EC50). m = Hill coefficient (slope). Emax = maximum effect."
msgstr ""

#: 585573bedcb84e7884e6d07883dc86ec of
#: tooluniverse.drug_synergy_tool.DrugSynergyTool._calculate_loewe:1
msgid "Calculate Loewe Additivity synergy score."
msgstr ""

#: b8b9c9a349954db6aa030d903d1627ce of
#: tooluniverse.drug_synergy_tool.DrugSynergyTool._calculate_loewe:3
msgid ""
"Loewe model: d_a/D_a(E) + d_b/D_b(E) = 1 for additive combinations. Where"
" D_a(E) and D_b(E) are the doses of A and B alone that produce effect E. "
"If the sum < 1, the combination is synergistic; > 1 antagonistic."
msgstr ""

#: af72e5fad18e4e8383c2ebba78406541 of
#: tooluniverse.drug_synergy_tool.DrugSynergyTool._calculate_loewe:7
